{"4492170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wavecraft Legends", "steam_appid": 4492170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492170/extras/d7fd2b40697e43962cb181de3b4311e5.avif?t=1781554027\" width=960 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the sandy beaches, the cool ocean air, and the carefree thrill of jet ski racing? <i><strong>Wavecraft Legends</strong> takes you back.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wavecraft Legends</strong></i> combines modern physics-based gameplay, rich narrative and character development, and the soul of classic arcade racing. Outpace legendary rivals and rise through the ranks in a challenging campaign where the ocean itself can be your greatest opponent. Succeed and unlock new playable characters, outfits, tracks, and gameplay customization features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492170/extras/9bdd5f336a6b0119e340a0548206939e.poster.avif?t=1781554027\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492170/extras/9bdd5f336a6b0119e340a0548206939e.webm?t=1781554027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492170/extras/9bdd5f336a6b0119e340a0548206939e.mp4?t=1781554027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But finishing on the podium will take more than overtaking your opponents. Just as you think you have someone beat on the last turn, a 3-foot swell sideswipes your watercraft and sends you careening offtrack. <strong>Your miscalculation: the water is not a friend.</strong> Each wave, wake, and ripple can change the course of a race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing the single player <strong>Story Campaign</strong> to its conclusion, unlocking rewards in <strong>Challenge Mode</strong>, setting personal bests in <strong>Time Trials</strong>, or simply soaking in the scenery in <strong>Spectator Mode</strong>, there's always another reason to get back on the water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492170/extras/a0b12082aa9deec8a50f96db79217064.poster.avif?t=1781554027\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492170/extras/a0b12082aa9deec8a50f96db79217064.webm?t=1781554027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492170/extras/a0b12082aa9deec8a50f96db79217064.mp4?t=1781554027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Game Modes:</strong> Story Campaign, Single Race, Time Trials, Challenge Mode, and Spectator Mode. You'll have plenty to do, and different ways to soak up the sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A compelling narrative: </strong>Family, legacy, loss, and redemption. These are just a few of the themes running through the Story Campaign. Sometimes, your racing results will even influence the story you experience via the visual novel-inspired dialogue sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dynamic Cast:</strong> Choose from 8 unique characters with rich backstories and full soft-body physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Around the World:</strong> Conquer over 15 tracks set across 5 breathtaking event locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable cosmetic Items: </strong>Win races and challenges to unlock alternate outfits and watercraft paint designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals:</strong> Race through scenic venues like tropical islands, arctic waterways, and even a theme park!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Control:</strong> Customize your experience with adjustable weather, time-of-day, wave intensity, and difficulty settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Racing:</strong> Master the racing line or hunt for &quot;Wind Zones&quot; for a speed boost—but stay sharp, missing buoys or checkpoints will set you back!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living Water:</strong> With <strong>physics-based wave simulation</strong>, the ocean is your greatest ally and your fiercest rival. Master the art of the waves and become a Wavecraft legend!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Come join us on the waves!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492170/extras/0c8bea13242f6ecc3d66c243348c9049.poster.avif?t=1781554027\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492170/extras/0c8bea13242f6ecc3d66c243348c9049.webm?t=1781554027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492170/extras/0c8bea13242f6ecc3d66c243348c9049.mp4?t=1781554027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_t