ations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable cosmetic Items: </strong>Win races and challenges to unlock alternate outfits and watercraft paint designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals:</strong> Race through scenic venues like tropical islands, arctic waterways, and even a theme park!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Control:</strong> Customize your experience with adjustable weather, time-of-day, wave intensity, and difficulty settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Racing:</strong> Master the racing line or hunt for &quot;Wind Zones&quot; for a speed boost—but stay sharp, missing buoys or checkpoints will set you back!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living Water:</strong> With <strong>physics-based wave simulation</strong>, the ocean is your greatest ally and your fiercest rival. Master the art of the waves and become a Wavecraft legend!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Come join us on the waves!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492170/extras/0c8bea13242f6ecc3d66c243348c9049.poster.avif?t=1781554027\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492170/extras/0c8bea13242f6ecc3d66c243348c9049.webm?t=1781554027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492170/extras/0c8bea13242f6ecc3d66c243348c9049.mp4?t=1781554027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Carve your legacy on the water. Wavecraft Legends is a physics-infused modern aquatic racer with a retro arcade soul. Master the waves, outpace storied rivals, and claim your 